{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_title", "source_sha256": "aba0c58c57446dadad2a429e32193376f6257a5503731136f92cd653b3a04a7e", "ja": "「Large Size Party」SPコミュ", "zh": "“Large Size Party”SP交流", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9c7b73fcf1c626ab0c87e3d0dd22993bcf31385eeef21852bb1a7a7ee3c95c15", "ja": "クリスマス公演を控え、みんなに\nパーティー気分で楽しんで欲しいと願う\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "这是圣诞公演前，偶像们希望大家能带着参加派对的心情尽情享受的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "475e64ea704cd5d1778f0f4413f142d2fcf0d5a9e275f6bd52ad8d75d7f1c166", "ja": "（いよいよ劇場でのクリスマス公演が始まる。\n客席は初日から満員御礼だ！）", "zh": "（圣诞公演终于要在剧场开幕了。\n观众席从首日开始就座无虚席！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "fefeccad98b2e67503d8f53a3643f6cca068201fb9ec01fc2ce0a21a1025f6db", "ja": "{$P$}、準備は整いました。\nあとは、幕が上がるのを待つのみです。", "zh": "{$P$}，准备已经就绪。\n接下来只需等待开幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "ed5d46bd466b18ee69c13ab7e913dbe9ec62b857a90fa8fb12333bf65c5b906a", "ja": "街はすっかり、くりすます模様。私達も、\n皆の心が浮き立つような公演にいたしましょう。", "zh": "街上已是一片圣诞气象。我们也要呈现一场，能让大家心情雀跃的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "779956a4cbcc2f9939fbbd932dd33282da6924105fa78ec6a1c8fdf83c524e76", "ja": "ファンのみなさんと私達の、クリスマスパーティー。\nふふっ、素敵な公演になりそうですね♪", "zh": "和粉丝们一起举办的圣诞派对。呵呵，感觉会是一场精彩的演出呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6cac1fe21c7c9251a8d421c0a04ae9e19c13249e54a6afca9d1d9152806b0cee", "ja": "ええ、街のイルミネーションに負けないくらい、\n楽しく輝く公演にしていきましょう！", "zh": "是啊，让这场公演变得既快乐又闪耀，丝毫不逊于街上的彩灯吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "7e611ee150b5be7e562d6c4f8b4e88f1f3fb002af31d25d7ffb65fad96e4bb9b", "ja": "はい。一年の最後のお祭りに、最高の思い出を\n届けられるように。……最高の公演にできればと。", "zh": "是的。为了给这一年的最后一场庆典留下最美好的回忆……希望能把它办成最棒的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "370e35ce1ab0a0717dd361a7e8a801e16a08a8a047b8fea5f8c37ad64656ad62", "ja": "そうですね。ずっと私達を支えてくれたファンの皆様と\nすべての方々に、感謝の気持ちを込めて……。", "zh": "是啊。向一直支持着我们的粉丝们，以及所有人，献上我们的感激之情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "b0d54524fe1f2ed94e26b66483a398bbb423142c5899bb6d4dd7a9745063e266", "ja": "とびきりの笑顔と、楽しい時間を届けましょう♪", "zh": "让我们用最灿烂的笑容，为大家带来一段快乐的时光吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7dad1df9ed4c9888eea6282111fb9d8f416546c02144b445d8ccf4fecd00677a", "ja": "お願いします。3人のステージは、劇場にクリスマスが\n訪れたことを告げる、鐘の音の代わりです。", "zh": "拜托了。由3人带来的舞台，将代替钟声，向剧场宣告圣诞节的到来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0312eefbc9f2878a84cdd2b0bb89ebac85f31c1e60a68731602187a3ed70ad5a", "ja": "と、いうことで……。", "zh": "所以说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_1010", "source_sha256": "6fcb35015b26c8dd8625dee0e86de1dea3e9abb9485f44b3c42079c6dd0bfbf5", "ja": "楽しんで！", "zh": "尽情享受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4cdf55abe6f36087f3cb4c6cea9cf9b7eb75a25cd8a92a6287277acd4f04d159", "ja": "思いきり、楽しんできてくれ！", "zh": "尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2004_p", "source_sha256": "e5e3d9dab6014b6765c2aea5c3eae77427a999be6a475f8b8eb7fad674394468", "ja": "あ、あれ？\n3人とも、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊，咦？3人，你们怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2005_010azu", "source_sha256": "964fa91c300f6aa6c9ba85a89f050356195ad6cdfe1ef75b3a9ba9cd7d3641fb", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さんも、\nしっかり楽しんでくださいね？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生也要好好享受哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2006_p", "source_sha256": "a55aede7eeb79dd07cec65a4e2d2775907839e8a153b1f386c36bbcd0d96dd7c", "ja": "いや、俺は裏方だし、別に大丈夫ですよ。\n次のステージの準備とかもあるし……。", "zh": "不用，我是幕后人员，没事的。\n而且还要为接下来的演出做准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2007_010azu", "source_sha256": "ccde234229c245d09c5febf07d922fbdfd997552ea9116b7d87bd4294b809de8", "ja": "いけませんっ。パーティーは、\nみんなで楽しむものです♪", "zh": "不行哦。派对这种事，\n就该大家一起开开心心的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2008_002chi", "source_sha256": "eb4b0bccaa0e96044bf9f751359ef12225de0cdf888d3b347cfc9b8ee08c6f6c", "ja": "じつは、みんなで相談したんです。\n私たち3人だけではなく、アイドル全員で。", "zh": "其实，我们大家商量过了。不是只有我们这3人，而是全体偶像一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2009_008tak", "source_sha256": "2844b1f8a085fcc34e5cda073e84c19f54e632cdf8932074af89162d02c65ab7", "ja": "この公演では私達アイドルにも、ステージが終った順に\n運営のお手伝いをさせていただけませんか？", "zh": "这场公演能否也让我们偶像在结束演出后，按照结束的先后顺序来帮忙呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2010_p", "source_sha256": "cd25c6e2cc1a5ad2f91f96a9b06d4df19c7ca121c4146e2c2b04c3ab01cd5c78", "ja": "え？　いや、出番がない子ならともかく、\n今回はみんな出番があるのに、そんな……。", "zh": "诶？不是……没有登台安排的孩子也就算了，这次大家都有演出，这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2011_008tak", "source_sha256": "5e5a5bbb73b1c5911647243b98977fa163580993d8201554171d57b79179b949", "ja": "くりすますは皆に平等に訪れるものと聞き及びます。\n{$P$}も、当然訪れるものかと。", "zh": "我听说，圣诞节会平等地降临到每个人身上。{$P$}当然也会到来的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2012_010azu", "source_sha256": "abe9213fbac17b02d0d16678346ec468222c5f08fc52a39c55807e19f40adc57", "ja": "私たちの出番は、少しずつですから。\n心配しないでくださいね？", "zh": "我们出场的机会，是一点一点积累起来的嘛。\n不用担心哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2013_002chi", "source_sha256": "0cf1ea4cc0027844095f5434f26e161cf625b43ad52116fbd776a7d0d6f4f535", "ja": "それに、{$P$}にステージを楽しんで\nもらえた方が、私たちも……張り合いが。", "zh": "而且，能让{$P$}享受舞台的话，我们也……更有干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2014_p", "source_sha256": "0c5c5fdd7377a67f9625aabbe35b1d9b3d9d1d2727d7f6b21e1ea06ccf008d46", "ja": "そうか……。ありがとう。\nそういうことなら、当てにさせてもらうよ。", "zh": "这样啊……谢谢你。\n既然这样，那我就指望你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2015_p", "source_sha256": "341d304dc7478a2bf1ba6b1a4f2c4f6ec404aa62237d8fc71150a8aae6c3ec10", "ja": "でも、まずはしっかり開幕の鐘を鳴らさないと。\nさあ時間です、あずささん！", "zh": "不过，首先还是得好好敲响开幕的钟声才行。\n好了，时间到了，あずさ小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2016_010azu", "source_sha256": "e854a347a0106473f0a464341998971335a2ed8af90831ebf10066d58ce32247", "ja": "はい♪　それじゃ、貴音ちゃん、千早ちゃん。\nみんなにとびきりの幸せが訪れるように……。", "zh": "好的♪那么，贵音、千早。\n愿最最幸福的时光降临到大家身边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2017_010azu", "source_sha256": "78ae3a14f8d15ef914599eb492aec7411f8a971d875bfca2e7df5697f962266f", "ja": "とびっきりの、パーティーを始めましょう♪", "zh": "让我们开始一场最棒的派对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_028_gc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_028_gc_01_2018_008tak", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
